  "description": "He has thousands of followers, a perfect setup, and a presence that stops the scroll.\n\nGetting his attention is already hard.\nGetting a date? Even harder.\nMaking him fall for you? That's the real challenge.\n\nEach one with his own channel, his own vibe, his own reason to be impossible to forget. Work your way up, get on their radar, and earn your way into their world.\n\nBecause behind the camera, they're just guys who want someone real.\n\nThe question is whether that someone is you.\n\nFeatures:\n\n● DATE YOUTUBERS: Each guy is a star in his own right. Gaming, lifestyle, drama, the ones who never show their face. Get close enough and find out who he really is when the camera's off.\n\n● MAKE HIM NOTICE YOU: He has thousands of fans. You have one shot. Go on dates around the city, say the right things, and become the one he actually thinks about.\n\n● KEEP THE CHAT GOING: Text him between dates. Don't go cold. Guys who get a lot of attention drop fast the ones who don't keep up.\n\n● UNLOCK EXCLUSIVE IMAGES: The closer he lets you in, the more he shares. Things his subscribers will never see.\n\n● MULTIPLE ENDINGS: Not every story ends the same. How far you get depends entirely on you.\n\n\nA guy with millions of eyes on him.\nCompletely out of reach.\nOr is he?\n\nProve you're worth his time.",
